ysical infrastructure or capital-intensive hardware/fleet/facility requirement; this is a software analytics/search tool.\",\n      \"source_url\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"flags\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"T5\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If offered as a hosted service ingesting arbitrary user newsletters, occasional support for broken imports/scraping failures may be needed, though largely automatable.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"competitors\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"StackDigest\",\n      \"url\": \"https://wonderingaboutai.substack.com/p/i-shut-down-my-ai-powered-startup\",\n      \"relationship\": \"direct\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"evidence\": \"Solo-founder AI digest, semantic search, and analytics tool for Substack readers, shut down due to reliance on Substack's undocumented/unofficial API and resulting compliance/legal risk.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Readless\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.readless.app/\",\n      \"relationship\": \"direct\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"evidence\": \"AI-powered digest merging Substack, newsletters, and RSS feeds into a single summary for readers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Metrisub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://metrisub.com/\",\n      \"relationship\": \"direct\",\n      \"pricing\": \"Free to start\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Analytics layer for Substack creators using official CSV export; engagement scoring, monetization insights, sponsor media kits.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Sublytics\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sublytics.org/\",\n      \"relationship\": \"direct\",\n      \"pricing\": \"Free to start\",\n      \"evidence\": \"AI insights on churn, revenue, and content from Substack CSV export; explicitly 'no scraping.'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"StackStats\",\n      \"url\": \"https://stackstats.app/\",\n      \"relationship\": \"direct\",\n      \"pricing\": \"$39/yr or $79 lifetime\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Local desktop analytics app for Substack writers using CSV e